{
  "_README": [
    "The evaluation corpus: task DEFINITIONS, not tests. The harness runs these",
    "and measures four metrics; tests verify the harness, never these numbers.",
    "Paths are relative to a fresh per-task temp root. A path-typed argument",
    "(per the manifest) is joined to that root by the harness; so are grants,",
    "fixtures and post-conditions. Every task carries a 'why' stating why it is",
    "in the corpus; an inclusion that cannot be justified was dropped.",
    "Categories: benign (task success + interruption), containment (out-of-scope",
    "attempts, each its own step 0), recovery (undo by journal replay), injection",
    "(in-scope calls the user never approved, delivered via re-plan after reading;",
    "these exist so the binding/taint ablation is observable - the four headline",
    "metrics alone cannot separate 'binding only' from 'no binding')."
  ],

  "benign": [
